Z||000000||Ronnie||01-28-2001||07:20 PM||||I installed a new pedal in my car today, fixed my clutch pedal problem.I had bled the clutch system before, but didn't aleviate the clutch being right on the floor for engagement,grinding gears when going into reverse, and such.Got a full pedal now. Feels like a clutch is supposed to feel!Have plenty of travel now.<P>------------------<BR>Black '86GT 4spd / Silver '87GT 5spd<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BOTHGTS_1.jpg"> ||||reg||6
