Z||000002||Ronnie||01-28-2001||09:59 PM||||Sorry, the pedal was with my car when I bought it , but it was a GM part.Had the invioce sticker attached to it.Seems like I've seen them somewhere, on here maybe, for 32 bucks? I just hadn't installed it because I thought my clutch pedal looked like it was the steel unit.But , I read today that some cars with the steel factory pedals could have the same symptoms as the aluminim. So I just decided to go ahead and change it, hoping for the best.It sure worked.<P>------------------<BR>Black '86GT 4spd / Silver '87GT 5spd<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BOTHGTS_1.jpg"> ||||reg||6
